    "created_at": "2026-08-14T11:40:23Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-08-14T11:40:23Z",
    "body": "I filed #51562. If it is useful I can test this on the affected path: we serve\nQwen/Qwen3.6-27B-FP8 (`Qwen3_5ForConditionalGeneration`, three linear attention layers to one\nfull) on an RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell, which goes through this builder.\n\nWe have not hit the symptom in production, so this is exposure rather than a reproduction. I can\nrun your branch on that deployment, and on a synthetic batch that puts a stateless one-token\nchunk alongside ordinary decodes.\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
