    "created_at": "2026-08-25T17:34:33Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-08-25T17:34:33Z",
    "body": "Thanks for picking this up.\n\nThe NVIDIA `KimiK3KDAMetadataBuilder` overrides `build()`, so this does not reach it. That path\nstill calls `split_decodes_and_prefills(m, decode_threshold=1)` when the batch has no speculative\ndecodes. maxpla3 notes the same gap in #51508. The ROCm builder only overrides\n`_build_chunk_metadata`, so it picks this up.\n\nCodex's padding-suffix point applied to my patch too. #51483 now carries the same subtraction.\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "reactions": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm/issues/comments/5414259617/reactions",
